{"title": "Graphs: edge list \u2192 adjacency list", "view": "graph", "steps": [{"nodes": [{"id": "0", "x": 0, "y": 1}, {"id": "1", "x": 1.5, "y": 0}, {"id": "2", "x": 1.5, "y": 2}, {"id": "3", "x": 3, "y": 1}, {"id": "4", "x": 4.5, "y": 1}], "edges": [{"from": "0", "to": "1"}, {"from": "0", "to": "2"}, {"from": "1", "to": "2"}, {"from": "1", "to": "3"}, {"from": "3", "to": "4"}], "vars": {"edges": [[0, 1], [0, 2], [1, 2], [1, 3], [3, 4]]}, "caption": "A graph: nodes (vertices) joined by edges. Problems usually hand you an EDGE LIST like this, or an adjacency matrix."}, {"nodes": [{"id": "0", "x": 0, "y": 1}, {"id": "1", "x": 1.5, "y": 0}, {"id": "2", "x": 1.5, "y": 2}, {"id": "3", "x": 3, "y": 1}, {"id": "4", "x": 4.5, "y": 1}], "edges": [{"from": "0", "to": "1"}, {"from": "0", "to": "2"}, {"from": "1", "to": "2"}, {"from": "1", "to": "3"}, {"from": "3", "to": "4"}], "vars": {"adjacency list": {"0": [1, 2], "1": [0, 2, 3], "2": [0, 1], "3": [1, 4], "4": [3]}}, "caption": "First step of almost every graph problem: build an adjacency list, node \u2192 its neighbours. Undirected edges are added in both directions."}, {"nodes": [{"id": "0", "x": 0, "y": 1}, {"id": "1", "x": 1.5, "y": 0}, {"id": "2", "x": 1.5, "y": 2}, {"id": "3", "x": 3, "y": 1}, {"id": "4", "x": 4.5, "y": 1}], "edges": [{"from": "0", "to": "1"}, {"from": "0", "to": "2"}, {"from": "1", "to": "2"}, {"from": "1", "to": "3"}, {"from": "3", "to": "4"}], "active": "1", "highlight": ["0", "2", "3"], "edgeHighlight": [["1", "0"], ["1", "2"], ["1", "3"]], "values": {"1": "deg 3"}, "vars": {"adj[1]": [0, 2, 3]}, "caption": "Neighbours of 1 are adj[1] = [0, 2, 3]: looking them up is O(degree). Degree of a node = its number of edges."}, {"nodes": [{"id": "0", "x": 0, "y": 1}, {"id": "1", "x": 1.5, "y": 0}, {"id": "2", "x": 1.5, "y": 2}, {"id": "3", "x": 3, "y": 1}, {"id": "4", "x": 4.5, "y": 1}], "edges": [{"from": "0", "to": "1"}, {"from": "0", "to": "2"}, {"from": "1", "to": "2"}, {"from": "1", "to": "3"}, {"from": "3", "to": "4"}], "values": {"0": "deg 2", "1": "deg 3", "2": "deg 2", "3": "deg 2", "4": "deg 1"}, "vars": {"V": 5, "E": 5, "sum of degrees": 10}, "caption": "Every edge adds 1 to two degrees, so degrees sum to 2E. Adjacency list: O(V + E) space; matrix: O(V\u00b2)."}]}
